### Create Notification
POST http://localhost:8086/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user-123",
  "orderId": "ord-456",
  "type": "ORDER_CREATED",
  "channel": "EMAIL",
  "recipient": "customer@example.com",
  "subject": "Your order has been placed",
  "content": "Thank you! Your order #ord-456 has been received."
}


### Get Notification
GET http://localhost:8086/api/v1/notifications/ed162916-629f-4761-bd7e-541f27f5a04e


### Update Notification Status
PUT http://localhost:8086/api/v1/notifications/{notificationId}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SENT"
}


### Retry Notification (only if FAILED)
POST http://localhost:8086/api/v1/notifications/{notificationId}/retry